for paths, revisions, hashes and modifications.

1. omlx — Apache License 2.0
   Source: https://github.com/jundot/omlx
   - PR #4050 head 65a07cab0cea09c9797ccc2c7744db85274f9252 (which carries
     PR #4023's row_exact_qmv.py with #4050's K-alignment fix):
     omlx/patches/row_exact_qmv.py — the Metal tile ``_TILE``, the decoded
     dot product ``_DECODED_DOT``, the launch source ``_SOURCE``, the launch
     geometry (``_launch_geometry``, ``_RPS``, ``_SHARED_ROWS_MIN_TILES``,
     ``_ROW_VALUES_BUDGET``) and the per-module plan cache, carried in
     src/mlx2/runtime/models/row_exact_qmv.py.
   - PRs #4023, #4041, #4052, #4105 and issues #4014, #4102 were read for the
     component inventory (projections, norms, attention rows, GDN, MoE
     window) and the fail-closed design; no other code is copied.
   The full Apache-2.0 text is this repository's LICENSE.

2. MLX — MIT License (scoped to the quantized dot-product helpers
